# Keep build context small. Match what's safe to exclude regardless of which
# Dockerfile is being built; per-stage COPY directives select what's actually
# needed.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/tests
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.js
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.js
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
# Keep packages/*/dist (referenced by Pattern B builds outside this context).
# Within urule/, dist is rebuilt during builder stage so excluding it here is
# fine; uncomment to skip pre-existing local dist:
#**/dist
